--- !u!1001 &7268561922346576413
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 299992585}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3893463633937401976, guid: 24e70d00260178029b36ff84b19525b4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Exposition
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6776095060359607615, guid: 24e70d00260178029b36ff84b19525b4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Cincinnati, 2019


        During the early hours of the morning an
        earthquake has been registered not so far away from the city. It was too
        small to wake anybody, and those lone souls who were awake at that hour barely
        noticed, if at all. Once the sun came up, life continued unbothered by last
        night''s events. That was until cracks were discovered on one of the roads
        leading to the city.


        Again, it was ignored. However, then someone
        in the local government mentioned the old abandoned metro, that runs under
        the city. Unfinished and forgotten, now became a point of concern for those
        in charge, as no one wanted to be blamed, should a tragedy occur. In a moment
        of panic, a civil inspector was tasked with inspecting the tunnels - you'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
